{"title":"Frost Giant","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=22\">Lv 22</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>50</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>46</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>50</td><td>in the wilds around -307, -941</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>46</td><td>in the wilds around -292, -946</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frost-giant\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 6 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 258 total, 27–65 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×27–65</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 5 of 6 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 8 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackalhide-head\" title=\"Jackalhide Head - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/cd220ec8b4588ac36d9c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackalhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"oak-crossbow\" title=\"Oak Crossbow - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0821ca52698bcfad058b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Oak Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-dagger\" title=\"Silver Dagger - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackalhide-legs\" title=\"Jackalhide Legs - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/32618f7713ad9256b405.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackalhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 5 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"cabbage-seeds\" title=\"Cabbage Seeds - in 1 of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/74054e903391bbba3896.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Cabbage Seeds</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-443.4px,426.6px)\"><i style=\"left:492.1px;top:-402.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:457.2px;top:-393.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:398.8px;top:-464.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:418.0px;top:-475.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:412.0px;top:-458.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:429.7px;top:-458.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:440.0px;top:-433.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:355.4px;top:-471.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:415.3px;top:-445.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:458.8px;top:-418.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:471.7px;top:-444.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:472.3px;top:-387.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:436.6px;top:-440.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:486.1px;top:-392.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:532.1px;top:-417.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:391.9px;top:-472.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:487.3px;top:-443.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:385.0px;top:-456.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:319.7px;top:-462.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:429.7px;top:-424.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:437.3px;top:-453.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:396.7px;top:-457.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:510.1px;top:-408.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:456.8px;top:-404.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:341.9px;top:-467.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:460.6px;top:-4